{ "Above 2X, every generated frame can land at the midpoint between two real frames, so 3X/4X\nshows more frames but no smoother motion. This gives each its own time.\nAuto / Reuse Blackwell kernel: uses the Blackwell interpolation kernel the DLSSG module\nalready carries. This is the default.\nRewrite blend weight: edits the Ada kernel's PTX instead. It only works on DLSSG builds\nit recognises. Try it only if 3X/4X motion is not smoother.\nini: [DLSSG] AdaTemporalFix. Save Settings and restart to apply.", "2X 以上时，生成帧可能落在两个真实帧的中点，因此 3X/4X\n帧数更多但运动不会更流畅。此选项会为每帧计算独立时间。\n自动 / 复用 Blackwell 内核：使用 DLSSG 模块\n自带的 Blackwell 插值内核。这是默认选项。\n重写混合权重：改写 Ada 内核的 PTX。仅适用于能识别的\nDLSSG 构建版本。只有在 3X/4X 运动没有变流畅时才建议尝试。\nini：[DLSSG] AdaTemporalFix。保存设置并重启以应用。" },
